      "writtenOn": "2024-08-21T16:42:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Note: the toolchain paths include version numbers which may change when new versions of the win_toolchain package are created.  We\u0027re referencing the version numbers here and in bazel/external/win_toolchain/BUILD.bazel.  We could eliminate the references here by creating symlinks in download_windows_toolchain.bzl (or maybe that needs to be done in bazel/external/win_toolchain/BUILD.bazel somehow) and by changing the globs in bazel/external/win_toolchain/BUILD.bazel to just include the whole parent directory (which shouldn\u0027t result in many extra files) or maybe by also using symlinks?\n\nInterestingly, I don\u0027t see any references to these versions in the GN build, so maybe it\u0027s possible to avoid them altogether?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 30,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 32,
        "endChar": 63
      },
      "revId": "fac5a30f45e097e8fd4c219950cb55b1cd477828",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
