      },
      "lineNbr": 32,
      "author": {
        "id": 5395
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-08-22T13:31:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Creating the symlinks in `download_windows_toolchain.bzl` seems like a reasonable thing to try.\n\nIt is curious if GN doesn\u0027t need to specify these paths... I wonder how that works?",
      "parentUuid": "38fa2b12_1d549191",
      "range": {
